<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - First Union started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - First Union started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Josephthal Lyon Ross analyst Frank Barkocy said he started coverage of First Union Corp with a buy rating</p>
<p>-- Analyst estimates EPS of $7.05 for 1997, $7.90 for 1998</p>
<p>-- Twelve-month price target is $100/shr</p>
</text>
